This repository holds icloud-session (session/, sessiond/), icloud-notes
(notes/, and its sync engine icloud-notes-sync in notes-sync/),
icloud-photos (photos/) and icloud-findmy (findmy/). The third-party
credits below apply to the parts named; everything else is the author's
own work.

