photos/ (icloud-photos)
============================================================================

The photos upload flow (photos/src/upload.rs: createUploadUrl, the content
upload, putAsset, uploadStatus) is ported from timlaing/pyicloud
(https://github.com/timlaing/pyicloud) services/photos_cloudkit/upload.py,
and photos/tests/fixtures/write/ (create_upload_url.json,
single_file_upload.json, put_asset*.json, upload_status.json,
delete_request_browser.json, delete_response.json) is
copied or adapted from its tests/fixtures. The read-side request shapes
and fixtures follow timlaing/pyicloud and picklepete/pyicloud
(https://github.com/picklepete/pyicloud) services/photos.py. Find My
(findmy/) and the sign-in (sessiond/) follow pyicloud's documented
endpoints too. Both pyicloud repositories are under the MIT License:

